{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d65f58f80b556a8d9c4dc32cfada828ba1cb37499c5439d2c449071be9a1a01b", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\nまつりは『イエティ』に扮して撮ることになった）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "3a6fb06ae161089127a33aa2a33d340732dfad8c1afbc29af8aeeec169649f62", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nUMAを信じていますか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1002_p", "source_sha256": "96f6a269bc76bed43d03845ee668af6a7077f8885d7b99a06336467511a19021", "ja": "うーん……いても不思議じゃないと思ってるから、\n信じてる方じゃないかな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "27fd27f533c54877d40198d483dc521d1f1891f2ce0c1e4fcd1ae3b366c80a34", "ja": "まつりとお揃いなのです♪　イエティさんも、\nきっと世界のどこかで暮らしているはずなのです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dac2266a266d71795e576a09c3d733e560bf95114884315fad901ed0507fefb0", "ja": "そうだなぁ。住んでるのは、こういう雪深い場所だと\nいうし、会える機会はなかなかなさそうだけど。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "ed834b2200120d93334fe5acd955db505830aa3ab0d2b8d80626b18d3c74e468", "ja": "そうなのです。だから、これはもしものお話……。\n{$P$}さんが雪山へ行った時……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "0afcdd3bdb016bb5b42ec53020dcbb31b06f552a089f400b045b328721770b37", "ja": "とびきり・きゅーと！なイエティさんに出会ったら\nどうしますか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a8eaedd56c68c382a76d3d861d5b0491236c76c106ea50df3d35735e2dc907f8", "ja": "どうって……。\n驚くと思うけど、多分それぐらいだな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5154a2abfb3a31aa55dfc78fcff454e0e3f074326cfadf39e8662033b643663f", "ja": "今、目の前にいるまつりイエティより\nかわいいイエティは存在しないと思うし……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "31abfce3973a2c8986596491a0baab2717268cf730a8951070d85f665a943b71", "ja": "……ほ？\n……、……ほっ？　ほ～っ！？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5dc3235e2912829dedea54649e82349e4b131a83c1d936e09da5b48659e0e11a", "ja": "まつり？　どうした？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "302f3906fea53606d2a98aabb48ce41f0e4bfaeea09d02d23eb3790fcb3d191d", "ja": "だ、大丈夫なのですっ！　ちょっとだけ想定外だった\nだけで、気にしてなんていないのですっ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1012_p", "source_sha256": "28c46fe749cf71dbd69edba0035ffcacbd49ef1aef32818e020ec9cc1c46a2eb", "ja": "そ、そうか。それならいいんだけど。\n……あ、そろそろ本番が始まる時間か。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "a80349517c29900150889f921c448e5257330fe366af6ab81ef25f300a394a76", "ja": "ふぅ～。それなら、まつりが確認してくるのです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "b35b2a1efcf8ca1d7fe9f1bc9f4d3332cf563c565d6d56593a8e3dc148199392", "ja": "だって、今の気持ちのまま撮ってもらいたいのです。\n……きっと、最高の写真になると思うから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c558aa3ee676c88ce88b12d153d5b1d66a5cd0d6a01a730fc503cecf69380514", "ja": "まつり……。", "zh": "茉莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0703_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "a31d2a95603f1fd140d255cc49cc69d6b98c4123871360f395ecd7525c0c4790", "ja": "それでは、行ってくるのです。\nちゃんと見ててね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
